{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7b04a2b339965733c55859bb81d8d44c10491757386c112f53a8ff2221ebcaa1", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。今から新曲の\n打ち合わせで、事務所に行こうと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。我正打算去事务所开个新歌的讨论会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "bb958838eb1e610b471c8c2569ecfbf5443edac0c20179a71c817ce333c2800e", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nいってらっ……。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}先生。慢走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d3c877026a36ca54194d84d05e2f3375780658a1a98eb0757ae7e6de27aba3bc", "ja": "その前に……これ、\n先日仕事をフォローして頂いたお礼です。", "zh": "在那之前……这个，\n是感谢您前几天在工作上帮忙的谢礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0690a83b12859c5719a882e05c4a8d6ff32ea8dfd00b0fcff3050e8fd1e40610", "ja": "ペットボトルのお茶くらいじゃ、\n日頃の感謝の印には足りませんけど。", "zh": "光是一瓶茶饮，实在不足以表达平日里的感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "e85f999fdcd36d3ac7df6477256d720e47a99f6aecbf68ba5f85f0342e0fc487", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます！　ちょうど\n喉が渇いていたので、いただきます。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您！正好口渴了，我就收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "6a92c044c19959b1fc9d6f48fb099b96fa55b9c08cb2436e235f6aa82d4b4948", "ja": "私でも、お力になれているみたいでよかったです♪\n……はっ！　感謝の印に、プレゼント……！", "zh": "看来连我也能帮上忙，真是太好了♪\n……啊！作为感谢的表示，送您礼物……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "179d4136dbe33427a5b1fe7fcc77e57057d7e32ccc4873929dc4559b6d5ec831", "ja": "？　はい、あんまり凝りすぎてもと思ったので\n劇場内で買ったものですけど……。", "zh": "？嗯，因为我想着也不能弄得太精致，所以这是在剧场里买的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "09de5988675ac2110c8633b31d848e6e6cf90aec9172ab6ba39e2122ddb8f886", "ja": "なるほど……言葉だけじゃなく、\n小さなプレゼントを添えても……？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，除了话语之外，再附上一份小礼物……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "52a20c78ac428edaf8e6a0ca93fde1307fa489164e2c51d94fd95cde3adff9e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お礼が上手ですね！\nそのアイディア、すっごく助かりました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您很擅长表达谢意呢！\n那个想法真的帮了大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ac2a575c5e30727335df6af3dd9ef8edab7c2784f962867e2a3c95bb6544d4ab", "ja": "そうですか？　何かの参考になったならよかったです！\nそれじゃ、事務所に行ってきますね。", "zh": "是吗？能帮上点忙就好！那我先去事务所了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "84f2a117f152ae96a466a3c8a1c2a006262fd10b9fc9ada1bb06dd0db83c137e", "ja": "はい。今度こそ……いってらっしゃーい♪　帰りに\n手芸屋さんに寄って、材料を買っていこうっと♪", "zh": "好的。这次总算……路上小心♪ 回来的时候顺便去一趟手工艺品店，买些材料回来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9aea1c61ae83fd414528eafdc1858852cd38f7585ba6414541b65edd4d2fa42b", "ja": "お疲れさまです。社長、例の新曲に関しての\n打ち合わせでうかがいましたが……。", "zh": "辛苦了。我是来和社长商量那首新歌的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "56d50a71b3cd47230aff257895bbdef68ddfd1dda21ff67fa1622efac530be22", "ja": "おお、待っていたよ、君！　新曲のデモも届いたし、\n打ち合わせに必要なものは揃ったようだ。", "zh": "哦，你终于来了！新曲的试听曲也送到了，洽谈所需的东西好像都准备齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5526f2aa3f27c3d002451c74fc440e5349037a55f9c1ab9994ab7e2af30088b9", "ja": "あっ、デモも届いたんですね！\nSHADE OF SPADEのラブソング……。", "zh": "啊，连新曲的试听小样也送到了！\n是SHADE OF SPADE的情歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "78e2ded0336dbfc56d3970a7317be8523327d601ce7fdfdb59661c85171ed18a", "ja": "うむ、私の知り合いの作曲家に、君のオーダーを\nしっかり伝えておいたよ。早速聴いてみよう！", "zh": "嗯，我已经把你提出的要求，\n好好转达给我认识的作曲家了。赶快来听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d189d6ab1396d30751d6fd88595d9f3f5cee140f7d3d795f8ff26957fe63d0d6", "ja": "こ、これは……！", "zh": "这、这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "c9307c843d148768e324edd424abefe98f3d9b27780b7061bcfb94d88a3602e7", "ja": "これは……いわゆる、ヤンデレ……でしょうか？\n攻めましたね！　{$P$}さん！", "zh": "这、这就是……所谓的病娇……吗？\n真是大胆啊！{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ea870bb984d6cdbe222a8523e43a2c0093a6ffa1f253277b43be7ba2c3f903e8", "ja": "いや、俺も驚いていて……。\n確かに、これは攻めていますね。", "zh": "不，我也很惊讶……\n这确实挺大胆激进的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "d24c3b11a470581dd3149be1559b38e58eacaadd26099c58a2c4875522e0037e", "ja": "え？　でも、{$P$}さんが\nオーダーをしたって……ということは、社長～？", "zh": "诶？可是，{$P$}先生下了这样的订单……也就是说，是社长～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "54820d6e59385d424d44996819643f7c816130ed86747cced76059c62bdd0fbc", "ja": "い、いや、私はちゃんと伝えたよ！\nSHADE OF SPADEのためのラブソングと！", "zh": "不、不对，我已经好好传达了！\n我说的是为SHADE OF SPADE创作的情歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "dec087048d6fa8eea7e3743d383f675f3f6b95dc6b5282b6a76353a7cd429114", "ja": "そうですね。なので、てっきりかっこいい系の曲が\n来ると思っていたので……驚きました。けど……。", "zh": "是啊。所以我还以为会来一首帅气风格的歌……挺惊讶的。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "2e700734e3da46aa37c160ea8eaf3f1cda78a982bce5af6eb61cc5cfa13b72e0", "ja": "でも、これはこれで素敵ですよね！\nこの歪さが、独特の魅力っていうか……。", "zh": "不过，这样也很棒不是吗！\n这种独特的韵味，应该说就是源于这份不协调感吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f3a8ab620d88a1a46168568553a24a5ac4e24690eced5f0511091c8958a78bb3", "ja": "はい。抗いがたい魅力があるのは確かですし、\n作家さんには歌唱メンバーもお伝えしていますから……", "zh": "是的。不可抗拒的魅力确实存在，而且我也已经把演唱成员告知作家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "cbfd88e7bd6c2aed6c1a11c00872bb45b78c40eceee29e9b26692dfddf9edd24", "ja": "このイメージが浮かんだのなら、それを活かします！\nそれに、意外性も武器になるはずですから。", "zh": "既然浮现出了这个形象，那就好好利用起来！\n而且，出人意料也应该能成为我们的武器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "286add06d1b9ee84be752dadad166ba39efa8e00290126ade1809a092dcda1ed", "ja": "うむ！　SHADE OF SPADE、\n今までとは違う色を見せてくれそうだね。", "zh": "嗯！SHADE OF SPADE，\n感觉会让我们看到不同于以往的色彩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "b1770d6f3a5844727ee456610438bb8468a5ed087f9c8696d9544e342411a43b", "ja": "今度の舞台は、西エリア……アイドル達とともに、\n765プロ旋風を巻き起こしてきてくれたまえ！", "zh": "这次的舞台是西部地区……和偶像们一起，去掀起765事务所旋风吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0ebdf6ef9955756db4b4601b8849a80352ebffe38239be4e62106312d904a158", "ja": "はい！　全力で行ってきます！！", "zh": "是！我会全力以赴的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
